# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloned upstream repositories — NOT ours to commit.
# These are other people's projects, each with its own .git folder.
# Committing them would either break (nested repos) or vendor
# someone else's code under our name. Anyone reproducing this work
# clones them fresh per planning/tsvd4j_run.md.
