# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Exception: findings/ holds copies of logs + reports we DO want on
# GitHub. Un-ignore it against the *.log / target / surefire-reports
# rules above (a leading "!" only works if no parent directory was
# already excluded, which is true here — findings/ isn't matched by
# any rule above).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
!findings/
!findings/**

